/MPPlugin58/Intermediate
/MPPlugin58/Source/MPPlugin58/Variant_Combat
/MPPlugin58/Source/MPPlugin58/Variant_SideScrolling
/MPPlugin58/Source/MPPlugin58/Variant_Platforming
/MPPlugin58/DerivedDataCache
